                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I saw that game first time on expo a year ago with the name Volts and Bolts.\nA game from one developer. With multiplayer, AI, lots of guns, maps. He quit his job to make the indie game. \nDamn I was impressed (:\nAnd now the release.\nCrazy battles in cartoon style, lots of fun, cute animation of UI.\nAnd there's one more pleasant thing.\nLike the great russian writer Chekhov once said, a game should be beautiful in every way—in its fun, in the gameplay, in animation and in its discount also.\nYou should try it (:",
